  "why": {
    "tokens": [
      {
        "t": "text",
        "v": "The run is a master-plan simulation. Period by period it works out the inventory the item is heading for, and where that falls short of the inventory plan it plans supply to cover the gap: a production plan, a purchase plan or planned distribution orders, by the item's sources of supply. It plans only inside the item's master-planning horizon, and it remakes a production or purchase plan only where the item allows it. Initializing the scenario recomputes the master plan but plans no supply, which is why this run exists."
      }
    ],
